# The goldens and the corpus are compared byte for byte, so the bytes have to be
# the same on every machine. Without this, Git for Windows rewrites text files to
# CRLF on checkout and every golden comparison fails there and nowhere else.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
